From: Aurelia contributors
Subject: Correct plugin diagnostics with current compiler and dependency APIs

Keep decoder-only declarations consistent with ENABLE_SOUT, use const-qualified read-only
lookup results, handle output format/control failures, preserve NUL termination in private
metadata tables, and fix real JSON flag precedence and early VAAPI cleanup initialization.
Modernize libass and optional JPEG API handling without suppressing compiler warnings.
The generated reentrant CSS parser never consumes its local syntax-error count; diagnostics
and recovery remain in yyerror and the existing parser state. The ID3 score table retains
its exact 21 standardized index/value pairs in C and C++ compatible initializer syntax.

